genereti_widget_values.guide:
{
  "format": "genereti-guide",
  "version": 1,
  "id": "genereticore-07-d1",
  "title": "d1 scene to artwork palette",
  "summary": "Learn on this editable graph. Inference starts only when you press Run.",
  "steps": [
    {
      "title": "Read the decision inputs",
      "text": "ꘅ Local Decision · state → allowed palette\n\nThe state describes the scene. The question asks for a palette. The two labels are allowed answers, not instructions to change scores.",
      "target": {
        "nodeType": "GeneretiCoreDecision",
        "nodeId": 2,
        "ref": "4b216da3-7bfd-5aa7-9ef4-042c6f06d051",
        "part": "parameter"
      },
      "hint": "Follow the note at the top of the workflow. Top Run updates connected nodes."
    },
    {
      "title": "Run one local decision",
      "text": "ꘅ Local Decision · state → allowed palette\n\nPress top Run. d1 evaluates options without generating text. Download is separate; first inference compiles and loads.",
      "target": {
        "nodeType": "GeneretiCoreDecision",
        "nodeId": 2,
        "ref": "4b216da3-7bfd-5aa7-9ef4-042c6f06d051",
        "part": "toolbar"
      },
      "hint": "Follow the note at the top of the workflow. Top Run updates connected nodes."
    },
    {
      "title": "Follow the creative mapping",
      "text": "ꘅ Choice to Value · palette label → hue\n\nThe selected label maps to a hue number. This authored map, not model-written code, controls paletteHue.",
      "target": {
        "nodeType": "GeneretiCoreChoiceValue",
        "nodeId": 3,
        "ref": "71ddd404-72ab-5736-a797-098486c93711",
        "part": "node"
      },
      "hint": "Follow the note at the top of the workflow. Top Run updates connected nodes."
    },
    {
      "title": "Compare two situations",
      "text": "ꘅ Text / JSON Viewer · decision distribution\n\nRead the distribution, then edit only the state to an entirely orange scene and Run again. Compare the palette. Try an ambiguous warm festival next and critique the decision.",
      "target": {
        "nodeType": "GeneretiCoreResult",
        "nodeId": 5,
        "ref": "4880d715-7b0b-50bc-93b3-d705df62c225",
        "part": "node"
      },
      "hint": "Follow the note at the top of the workflow. Top Run updates connected nodes."
    }
  ]
}

